    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86dce41c763dfaf98ef6cb36",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那天，我没能看清她的脸，也没能问到她的名字。\r\n但无论如何，我都想知晓那位英雄的身份——",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf060f3bfba05d01104b8e70590fbde5c659854c3465e48a9f6ba613412d56ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
