      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这倒完全出乎我的意料，而且这也非我的本意。\r\n这里是特雷森学园，学生的本分应是奔跑才对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c347423a0f1b09cadbdd27deec25d3ed66a38d30849e74a33387f1a6107c413e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
