    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5968444f09fd637c5a9fa858",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没、没关系的，我能同时兼顾两方的！\r\n……我想知道，为何训练员会认为那位赛马娘『如英雄一般』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "752d0a5b3ec4c61e2b7f53d988fa359836d4fc9d7fe098e324cfd7b00cd7c201",
