    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fb0abe4b649ef60d4be95f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我满心都想着那位『英雄』的事情，\r\n最后索性决定来图书馆找些英雄奇谭读读看……\r\n但却怎么都找不到传记类的作品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a57841c9a0785e597e9d2de10116b86350ffc4f8924339189f7274c8635632a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047001.json",
      "json_path": [
