    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c740e019b3ff79ce5ba280e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我、我是……荒漠英雄。\r\n是这里的图书馆管理员……！\r\n那个……您要是想找什么书的话，我应该能帮上您的忙……",
      "source_fingerprint": "acc25a7cf2d2fbfad47bc4386899cda8de91762762abd6d27dcd9d7cdcc07c8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e7051780df8d1f128ff9ba4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那……请问传记类作品在哪里呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "903dba7432b1887f8ee3b6fa020e9222e55fcbd44af68a563a5af954fe41920b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
