    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1e9ce5639a011e81f114f3d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "传记……！的确，这个分类很容易令人混淆呢。\r\n其实传记类的作品没有放在历史区，而是放在小说与散文区的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c19d1fe68b97cdc9b06c34982b44e6e46a0f75bc35be7d34b6835988d62ab13a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
