      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……那么，关于您那日所见的英雄女士，\r\n我也私底下稍微进行了一些调查。那么调查结果是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "47713d75e6e2bee11ab89a5f9bc64ef620e4ba150a281b3235d043d187473b0e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bb8d5923ab96a5ef5b44830",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
