    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11ef838121f7510273bcff1a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……她是我所憧憬的前辈。\r\n实力强劲、疾驰如风、凛然帅气……\r\n而且，她也已经顺利出道了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e17c798de2b335e13bb6f5428426d49275c5981e2ee197dc8acfa3a655f839a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
