      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吉兆小姐今天似乎也在训练的样子……\r\n我们一起去看看吧，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f20e3674e0982aa724299078ee84df3171d3230cf837664900b3ee8ba27e0ca",
