    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40118557e97075b493bee4fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也许是因她天生的体格优势，她的跑姿看上去力量感十足。\r\n虽然她奔跑的模样实在是令人惊叹……\r\n但是，我觉得她与那日所见的英雄并非同一人物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc82d27870155b34567d202dbe4b018ecab95a559f4d2b8775640fadd17acc89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0c013a3cf013c9150520755",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那位『英雄』的话，应该更有种“紧追不舍”的感觉。\r\n即便对手遥不可及也要死命追赶、脚步中充斥着对胜利\r\n的执着才对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdfbe82dcd4113142ebff98e6b15c2d4fb373e086d6c6e65b6022f1bb9293180",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3e905ff22983dd94b717e18",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我正准备将这番话告诉罗布罗伊时——",
      "source_fingerprint": "cff3545df970241ec023f19b4763f6c1d67f4b553eb70a1b9e3b5a68767a014b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82d7cad0c814525cefdca753",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
