    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68d4da5b12b4f6a0518d178d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的脚步……乍一看像是全凭蛮力前进，实则截然不同。\r\n可以感觉到她有对脚步进行精确计算……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6acadc8f4ce4ed7a8e22712e4756d7e723f0f122bfc0de5cad23a563d30689a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047002.json",
      "json_path": [
