    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c382b03b6d3da1742d9807f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先是您见到那位英雄女士的时间段。\r\n这应该是自主训练的时间段吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a605efe6de18dd3eeedc32ec746368c2333c6e12d7cf7563725aff620989d0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
