    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4509897fefd338fba027f637",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "暂休时间就这么一小会儿……为了冰敷得稍微久一些吗？\r\n吉兆小姐的时间管理真是严格……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad48e858b1938562ead96c3a74d80bca84ad770e4c1ae10c7aba7bb69bf46f44",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
